      "text": {
        "jp": "あの時、力を使い果たして……\r\nそれで、あの子が表に出てしまったってわけ。",
        "official_en": "It was then, when I exhausted all my power, that girl took over.",
        "real_en": "Back then, I used up all my power... and that was when the other girl came to the surface."
